From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 11:56:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] NeoForge ModLauncher runtime hooks for ServerModLoader
 completion

Add ArgumentTypeInfos.registerByClass, Ingredient list codecs,
SpawnPlacements/CreativeModeTab/BlockEntityType hooks, datapack
registry sync (RegistryDataLoader/WorldLoader), biome/structure
modifier accessors, ChunkGenerator.refreshFeaturesPerStep, and
ServerLevel capability listener cleanup so ServerModLoader.load()
and handleServerAboutToStart complete under Folia.

